This repository is packaged as a Material Design 3 (M3) based component system.
M3 system tokens (md-sys), state layer values, and elevation levels follow the
Material Design 3 guidance published by Google:

  Material Design 3 — color role system, state layer opacities
  (hover 8% / focus 12% / pressed 12% / dragged 16%), and elevation levels.

Typefaces referenced by name only (loaded from Google Fonts at runtime, not
bundled in this repository):

  - Inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1, by Rasmus Andersson)
  - Geist Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1, by Vercel)

